# online-portfolio — agent context

**PRIORITY #1: SECURITY** — see `.cursor/rules/security-first.mdc` and `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md` § Security.

**Status:** monorepo scaffold (DEV-001). Next: DEV-002 Docker Compose. Read `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md` and `docs/BACKLOG.md` before coding.

## Hard rules

- **Security:** tenant isolation, no IDOR, secrets server-only, validate inputs, invite-only auth
- **BFF:** browser → Nuxt proxy → API — never direct Render from browser
- **Auth:** ASP.NET Identity **completo** + JWT on API; roles via `AspNetRoles` / `AspNetUserRoles`
- **No** Supabase Auth, **no** `@nuxtjs/supabase`, **no** anon key in frontend
- **Admin login:** only `app.onlineportfolio.com.br` — not tenant subdomains
- **Public sites:** `{slug}.onlineportfolio.com.br` per tenant
- **Email v1:** SendGrid `noreply@` send-only — no mailbox
- **Secrets:** never commit `.env` or API keys; service role only on backend

## Roles (v1)

`PlatformAdmin` (add users, any tenant) · `Owner` · `Editor` — invite-only, no self-signup

## Order

Epic 0 scaffold → Epic 1.5 (login + add user) → Epic 1 (public sites). See BACKLOG sprint order.

## Repository

**Monorepo** — one Git repo; `frontend/` (Vercel) + `backend/` (Render). Not separate repos.

## Commits

Conventional Commits — see `.cursor/rules/conventional-commits.mdc`

## Git flow & CI

- **Workflows separados:** `ci-backend.yml` + `ci-frontend.yml` + `deploy-backend.yml` + `deploy-frontend.yml` — not one combined CI.
- **Deploy:** production only on `main` ([ADR-015](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#adr-015-deploy-somente-em-production)); no staging stack in v1.
- **Before merge:** green CI + cross-stack component review (API ↔ proxy/types/UI, schema ↔ migration, auth/env both sides).
- Full checklist: `docs/AGENT_GUIDE.md` § Git flow · `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` §15

